#### 4. Mystery Guest
**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 140)  
**Evidence:** `File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv")` — external file dependency, hard-coded absolute Windows path.
```csharp
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```
**Fix:** Inline the test data:
```csharp
const string csv = "SKU,Qty\nSKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,4\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,3";
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csv);
Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
```
**Risk:** Fails on any machine without that file; non-reproducible on Linux CI.

